      "instance_name": "mocking_skin_tone",
      "label": "mocking skin tone scene",
      "description": "A scene where a Black man is depicted against a plain white background, with overlaid text that reads 'this nigga so black they had to change his background white.' The text is a racist trope mocking the person's skin tone by implying his natural color is so dark that it necessitated a white background to be visible. The scene is composed of the man and the text, with the text positioned above the man's head, creating a visual and textual punchline rooted in racial prejudice.",
